 "title": "1 A Schottky barrier diodes, 20 V to 40 V, SOD-323",
 "source": {
  "revision": "",
  "pages": 4
 },
 "summary": "1N5817WS, 1N5818WS and 1N5819WS are single Schottky rectifiers in the two-lead SOD-323 surface-mount case, rated 20 V, 30 V and 40 V reverse. Each carries 1.0 A average forward current with 9 A surge capability, and drops at most 0.45 V to 0.60 V at 1 A depending on voltage grade. Intended uses are polarity protection and inverters running at high frequency from low voltages.",
